1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,900
"The Missing Piece"

2
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,800
(Episode 5)

3
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,599
My big brother's birthday is coming up.

4
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:03,159
Shen.

5
00:02:03,239 --> 00:02:05,479
What are you planning to
get my brother for his birthday?

6
00:02:05,719 --> 00:02:07,200
Help me figure it out.

7
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:09,120
I'm trying to think of something too.

8
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:12,800
A regular gift would be so boring.

9
00:02:13,733 --> 00:02:15,933
Why don't you buy two plane tickets?

10
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,919
How about taking a trip abroad together?

11
00:02:18,439 --> 00:02:21,239
Even the best gift can't
compare to a beautiful memory.

12
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,240
Don't you think?

13
00:02:22,879 --> 00:02:23,680
A trip?

14
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:24,360
Yeah.

15
00:02:24,479 --> 00:02:27,121
That island I went to with Zhou
Yang last time was pretty nice.

16
00:02:27,233 --> 00:02:29,752
Blue skies, white clouds, the beach.

17
00:02:31,479 --> 00:02:32,598
Just thinking about it feels romantic.

18
00:02:32,599 --> 00:02:33,319
Shen.

19
00:02:33,343 --> 00:02:34,502
What do you think of my idea?

20
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:38,742
What if Mr. Ji and I vacationed on the
island where Zhou Yang proposed to Ji An'an?

21
00:02:39,192 --> 00:02:40,752
Wouldn't that be a little awkward?

22
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,400
It's actually a pretty good idea.

23
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:45,280
But the holidays are coming up.

24
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,376
There'll definitely be a lot
going on at the company

25
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,080
Mr. Ji may not have time.

26
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,680
Come on.

27
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:53,400
Just wait until he gets back and
ask him directly.

28
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:56,039
A perfect couple like you two

29
00:02:56,439 --> 00:02:57,479
on an island.

30
00:02:58,439 --> 00:02:59,839
Just imagining it sounds wonderful.

31
00:03:01,719 --> 00:03:03,919
You should focus on what
you're going to get him.

32
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,319
Come on.

33
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,280
This is driving me crazy.

34
00:03:14,599 --> 00:03:15,599
Big brother, come on.

35
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,159
Time to eat.

36
00:03:17,159 --> 00:03:18,159
Yeah.

37
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:24,759
Big brother.

38
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:28,039
Are you busy in early
February? Are you free?

39
00:03:28,686 --> 00:03:31,520
Why are you suddenly asking?
What's up? Is something wrong?

40
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,120
Come on.

41
00:03:32,121 --> 00:03:34,279
Just tell me if you're free.

42
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,600
Just tell me whether you're busy.

43
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,919
If you're not busy,

44
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,239
Shen wants to go with you.

45
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,240
An'an.

46
00:03:44,159 --> 00:03:46,240
I need to check my schedule for next month.

47
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:48,840
Eat first.

48
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:03,319
This is good.

49
00:04:03,879 --> 00:04:04,960
Try this.

50
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,520
Have a taste.

51
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:09,599
I'm full.

52
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,758
Go give my brother a little push.

53
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:18,600
Otherwise, he'll forget about it again

54
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:20,318
I still have to do the dishes.

55
00:04:20,319 --> 00:04:22,240
Come on. That's not important.

56
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,439
Go, go.

57
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,480
Okay, okay, okay.

58
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,480
Go

59
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,480
I'm going.

60
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,040
That's right.

61
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,680
Those few days in early February.

62
00:04:31,439 --> 00:04:33,079
I don't care how you do it.

63
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,639
Move things up or push them back.

64
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:38,160
Just make sure you're
free in early February.

65
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:40,839
I never would've guessed.

66
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:43,480
Mr. Ji can be pretty cute sometimes.

67
00:04:54,319 --> 00:04:55,319
Go ahead.

68
00:04:56,199 --> 00:04:57,959
What exactly are you and An'an planning?

69
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:02,199
Early February is my birthday.

70
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:05,040
An'an suggested

71
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:08,480
that you and I go on vacation
to the island she went to before.

72
00:05:10,839 --> 00:05:12,199
And you agreed?

73
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,959
As long as Mr. Ji is okay with it.

74
00:05:16,759 --> 00:05:17,759
I have no objection.

75
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:23,279
I don't like that island.

76
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,040
Let's pick somewhere else.

77
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:27,800
I'm free those days.

78
00:05:29,439 --> 00:05:31,120
I'll have my secretary book the tickets.

79
00:05:31,639 --> 00:05:33,639
Just pack your bags over the next few days.

80
00:05:36,199 --> 00:05:39,480
I never would've guessed
Mr. Ji was such a good liar too.

81
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:20,839
Mr. Ji.

82
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:24,000
Do you actually like me a little bit?

83
00:07:57,839 --> 00:07:59,279
If I didn't like you,

84
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:02,360
why would I get turned on by you?

85
00:08:13,173 --> 00:08:14,173
What's wrong?

86
00:08:14,319 --> 00:08:15,480
Are you busy today, Mr. Ji?

87
00:08:15,759 --> 00:08:18,016
I made a last-minute appointment
with the owner of that media company.

88
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:20,336
I'd like to discuss a partnership
with you while you're available today.

89
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,560
Does it have to be today?

90
00:08:22,839 --> 00:08:25,479
I need to take care of An'an's
wedding arrangements this afternoon.

91
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:26,759
Today would be best.

92
00:08:27,319 --> 00:08:29,599
The company's chairman is
leaving on a business trip soon.

93
00:08:29,639 --> 00:08:31,959
Why don't you have
Mr. Shen accompany An'an first?

94
00:08:32,279 --> 00:08:33,679
It won't take up much of your time.

95
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:34,840
Oh.

96
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:39,159
What's wrong?

97
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,600
Zhao Yi.

98
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:47,200
He arranged a meeting for me
with the owner of an AI company later.

99
00:08:47,399 --> 00:08:48,600
I contacted him before

100
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:50,639
to ask him to make the connection.

101
00:08:54,279 --> 00:08:55,279
Oh.

102
00:08:55,399 --> 00:08:57,000
As for An'an this afternoon...

103
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,360
Go in my place for now.

104
00:09:00,159 --> 00:09:01,439
I'll head over as soon as I can.

105
00:09:01,775 --> 00:09:02,576
Mm.

106
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,600
Okay.

107
00:09:16,159 --> 00:09:17,159
What's wrong?

108
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:18,879
Nothing.

109
00:09:30,879 --> 00:09:32,519
I'm sorry, I'm late.

110
00:09:32,559 --> 00:09:33,200
It's okay.

111
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,000
Shen.

112
00:09:34,001 --> 00:09:35,375
Thank goodness you were here today.

113
00:09:35,399 --> 00:09:36,678
Without you

114
00:09:36,679 --> 00:09:37,878
with my brother acting like that

115
00:09:37,879 --> 00:09:39,840
I might've had to come alone today.

116
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:40,759
It's okay.

117
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:41,800
It's the least I could do.

118
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,320
Help me take a look.

119
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,719
Do you think this one looks better

120
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:45,840
or this one?

121
00:09:46,496 --> 00:09:47,457
I think they're both nice.

122
00:09:47,481 --> 00:09:48,799
They're just different styles.

123
00:09:49,039 --> 00:09:49,840
Yeah.

124
00:09:49,841 --> 00:09:51,120
Whichever one you like.

125
00:09:52,039 --> 00:09:53,158
I'm so nervous.

126
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:54,359
Do you think I should wear

127
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,799
a satin wedding dress

128
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:57,279
or one made of tulle?

129
00:09:57,759 --> 00:09:58,480
Oh.

130
00:09:58,504 --> 00:10:00,302
What if there are a lot of people that day...?

131
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:04,613
[Mrs. Zhou]

132
00:10:04,639 --> 00:10:05,678
Auntie, I have to tell you

133
00:10:05,679 --> 00:10:07,799
I've really been wanting
to see you since I came back.

134
00:10:10,279 --> 00:10:12,039
Isn't that Mrs. Zhou and Zhou Chu?

135
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:13,840
Let's go say hi.

136
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,320
I'm not going.

137
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,080
It's okay.

138
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:18,360
Come on.

139
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,320
Don't be nervous.

140
00:10:19,321 --> 00:10:20,879
We'll be family from now on.

141
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:23,000
I'm not close with Mrs. Zhou.

142
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,440
You go.

143
00:10:25,919 --> 00:10:26,960
Then I'll go by myself.

144
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:27,440
Yeah.

145
00:10:27,639 --> 00:10:28,639
Take a break first.

146
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:30,759
I hope

147
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:32,480
you understand your place.

148
00:10:32,919 --> 00:10:33,600
Auntie

149
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,519
I didn't...!

150
00:10:34,519 --> 00:10:35,279
Auntie Zhou.

151
00:10:35,279 --> 00:10:35,879
Oh.

152
00:10:35,879 --> 00:10:36,879
An'an.

153
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,120
What are you doing here?

154
00:10:38,559 --> 00:10:39,720
You look beautiful today.

155
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:41,839
Let's talk over there.

156
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,240
Yeah.

157
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,240
Okay.

158
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,559
If he were here,

159
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,600
no one would dare humiliate me like this.

160
00:11:07,953 --> 00:11:11,540
[Ji An'an: Shen, I'm not feeling well,
I'm resting in room 2505, come up ASAP]

161
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,480
Mr. Ji once told me

162
00:11:14,639 --> 00:11:16,735
that An'an has been frail
and sickly since she was little.

163
00:11:16,759 --> 00:11:19,799
If she feels even the slightest discomfort
she has to go to the hospital right away.

164
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:24,720
Hello.

165
00:11:24,721 --> 00:11:27,480
The number you have dialed
is temporarily unavailable.

166
00:11:27,799 --> 00:11:29,679
An'an is clearly with Mrs. Zhou.

167
00:11:29,799 --> 00:11:32,479
Why wouldn't she call someone
from the Zhou family if she felt sick?

168
00:11:32,759 --> 00:11:34,720
Even if she sees me as family

169
00:11:35,039 --> 00:11:36,679
and feels reassured only when she sees me,

170
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:38,320
she could've just called.

171
00:11:38,759 --> 00:11:40,159
Why send me a text?

172
00:11:42,096 --> 00:11:42,895
What's wrong?

173
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:43,919
Mr. Ji.

174
00:11:44,399 --> 00:11:45,918
An'an said she wasn't feeling well.

175
00:11:45,942 --> 00:11:47,702
She's in room 2505 at the Dynasty Hotel.

176
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,119
But I can't get in touch with her.

177
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:49,639
Okay.

178
00:11:49,639 --> 00:11:50,600
I'll be right there.

179
00:11:50,601 --> 00:11:52,158
An'an is with the Zhou family.

180
00:11:52,159 --> 00:11:53,360
It should be nothing serious.

181
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:54,479
Be careful.

182
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:55,600
If anything seems wrong

183
00:11:55,759 --> 00:11:56,959
call an ambulance immediately.

184
00:11:57,159 --> 00:11:58,159
Okay.

185
00:12:05,919 --> 00:12:06,919
An'an.

186
00:12:07,679 --> 00:12:08,679
An'an.

187
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,920
Why did it take you so
long to get the clothes?

188
00:12:11,679 --> 00:12:12,480
Shen Mo.

189
00:12:12,639 --> 00:12:13,639
What are you doing here?

190
00:12:13,739 --> 00:12:14,739
Where's An'an?

191
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,679
She told me she wasn't feeling well.

192
00:12:26,879 --> 00:12:27,879
Open it.

193
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,080
Can't you open it?

194
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,240
We...

195
00:12:41,759 --> 00:12:43,159
We were set up.

196
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:45,440
That bastard Zhou Chu.

197
00:12:46,519 --> 00:12:47,558
Your brother did this.

198
00:12:47,559 --> 00:12:49,158
He spilled coffee on me.

199
00:12:49,159 --> 00:12:50,120
Then he booked this room

200
00:12:50,121 --> 00:12:51,161
so I could change clothes.

201
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:53,120
What about you?

202
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:54,639
Why are you here?

203
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:57,279
He took Miss Ji's phone

204
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:59,638
and told me she wasn't feeling well

205
00:12:59,639 --> 00:13:00,655
and asked me to come check on her.

206
00:13:00,679 --> 00:13:02,000
But this is way too coincidental.

207
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:04,159
You and An'an are both at this hotel.

208
00:13:04,519 --> 00:13:06,480
Miss Ji loves the afternoon tea here.

209
00:13:06,759 --> 00:13:08,680
We come here all the
time to have it together.

210
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:12,159
Zhou Chu suggested that today...

211
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:14,760
we should come to this hotel
for afternoon tea as a family.

212
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,816
Looks like your wonderful little brother

213
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:19,599
has done his homework.

214
00:13:19,623 --> 00:13:21,623
He even knows where Miss Ji and I go.

215
00:13:22,817 --> 00:13:24,576
No wonder I thought something was off

216
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:26,240
when I saw him at the auto show that day.

217
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:28,000
I suspect

218
00:13:28,799 --> 00:13:30,759
he already knows about
our past relationship.

219
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,200
So what if he does?

220
00:13:32,679 --> 00:13:34,559
Is there anyone in your
family who doesn't know?

221
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,000
Besides...

222
00:13:37,159 --> 00:13:39,239
you and I have nothing to
do with each other anymore.

223
00:13:49,879 --> 00:13:51,360
Hello. Front desk?

224
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:53,519
The door to Room 2505 is locked.

225
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:55,158
Could you come up and unlock it?

226
00:13:56,519 --> 00:13:57,519
Thanks.

227
00:14:04,879 --> 00:14:05,879
Hello.

228
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:08,000
Mr. Ji.

229
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,200
What the hell are you doing?

230
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:13,919
Mr. Ji, Mr. Ji.

231
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,160
Do you think Ji Mingxuan is a good person?

232
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,518
He's just like Zhou Chu.

233
00:14:17,519 --> 00:14:19,320
They'll do anything to get what they want.

234
00:14:20,632 --> 00:14:21,712
What are you trying to say?

235
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,000
What am I trying to say?

236
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:30,159
I've already looked into everything.

237
00:14:30,759 --> 00:14:31,759
Yes.

238
00:14:31,919 --> 00:14:32,919
It was my fault.

239
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:35,960
I went abroad with An'an behind your back.

240
00:14:38,519 --> 00:14:41,159
But guess what Ji Mingxuan did.

241
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:45,960
He told my parents about your
identity and our relationship.

242
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:49,600
And you still treated him like your savior.

243
00:14:49,639 --> 00:14:51,079
He was the one who started all this.

244
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:03,279
Stay away from Zhou Yang.

245
00:15:03,632 --> 00:15:04,313
Do you understand?

246
00:15:04,398 --> 00:15:05,798
The day I was kidnapped

247
00:15:05,790 --> 00:15:06,150
[Zhou Yang]

248
00:15:06,212 --> 00:15:07,360
I called the police first.

249
00:15:07,759 --> 00:15:09,200
Then I called Zhou Yang.

250
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:11,879
So why was Mr. Ji the one who rescued me?

251
00:15:13,639 --> 00:15:15,840
Why did Mr. Ji get there before the police?

252
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:19,960
Or did the police rescue me first
and Mr. Ji showed up afterward...

253
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:24,160
I was kidnapped right
after Zhou Yang went abroad.

254
00:15:24,399 --> 00:15:26,720
Did Zhou's parents already know I existed?

255
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:31,440
Or was Ji Mingxuan trying to secure his sister's
happiness by getting rid of me as an obstacle?

256
00:15:32,559 --> 00:15:34,480
Then why did he say he liked me?

257
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:41,519
Ji Mingxuan puts profit above everything.

258
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:43,959
He schemed to break us up.

259
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:46,135
All for the marriage alliance
between the Zhou and Ji families.

260
00:15:46,159 --> 00:15:46,840
That's not true.

261
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:47,840
He did it for his sister.

262
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:51,080
How can you still believe his bullshit?

263
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:54,600
He knew perfectly well I never loved An'an.

264
00:15:54,879 --> 00:15:56,399
He forced us together.

265
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:59,360
He wasn't doing it for his sister at all.

266
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:06,159
Even if Mr. Ji did it on purpose...

267
00:16:07,086 --> 00:16:08,925
wasn't everything you did your own choice?

268
00:16:11,879 --> 00:16:17,919
Weren't you willing to go abroad
with Miss Ji and to get engaged to her?

269
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:20,759
You clearly didn't love her.

270
00:16:22,039 --> 00:16:24,039
Why did you deceive her feelings like that?

271
00:16:24,386 --> 00:16:25,386
I...

272
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,720
I had the Zhou family behind me.

273
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:29,440
I had no choice.

274
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:30,720
You had no choice?

275
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:32,840
You're wrong.

276
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:35,600
You did have a choice.

277
00:16:36,879 --> 00:16:38,559
You chose the life you have now.

278
00:16:39,759 --> 00:16:41,679
Even if Mr. Ji hadn't said anything,

279
00:16:44,399 --> 00:16:46,080
you'd still be doing the same thing.

280
00:16:47,039 --> 00:16:48,159
Getting married.

281
00:16:48,919 --> 00:16:49,919
Having kids.

282
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:53,240
And keeping me as your secret lover.

283
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:55,360
Zhou Yang.

284
00:16:56,759 --> 00:16:57,919
You're just like them.

285
00:17:00,159 --> 00:17:01,960
You're selfish.

286
00:17:03,440 --> 00:17:04,880
And you put profit above everything.

287
00:17:12,319 --> 00:17:13,720
People who truly love each other...

288
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:21,960
can't be torn apart by any
scheme or underhanded tactic.

289
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,119
If they do,

290
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:30,840
it only means they didn't
love each other enough.

291
00:17:38,319 --> 00:17:39,400
If...

292
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:41,720
I...

293
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,640
If I could give up everything...

294
00:17:46,799 --> 00:17:47,799
Mo.

295
00:17:48,039 --> 00:17:49,039
Could we...

296
00:17:51,839 --> 00:17:53,199
Could we start over?

297
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:54,200
It's impossible.

298
00:17:59,119 --> 00:18:00,119
Mo.

299
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:02,439
You're the only one I love.

300
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:03,240
I...

301
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:04,559
I can't live without you.

302
00:18:05,079 --> 00:18:05,920
I can't live without you.

303
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:06,920
You're the only one in my heart.

304
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:07,240
Please.

305
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:07,559
Mo.

306
00:18:07,559 --> 00:18:08,559
Let go.

307
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:09,680
Let go

308
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:11,000
I said it's impossible.

309
00:18:20,359 --> 00:18:21,359
An'an.

310
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:25,200
An'an.

311
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:27,359
An'an.

312
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:28,559
An'an, let me explain.

313
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:29,840
It's not what it looks like.

314
00:18:34,759 --> 00:18:35,839
There's no need to explain.

315
00:18:37,519 --> 00:18:38,559
I heard everything.

316
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:47,400
Zhou Yang.

317
00:18:48,759 --> 00:18:50,880
I couldn't believe what
your brother told me at first.

318
00:18:51,839 --> 00:18:52,839
You...

319
00:18:54,079 --> 00:18:55,559
What you just said was true...?

320
00:18:57,359 --> 00:18:58,680
You never loved me...?

321
00:19:02,279 --> 00:19:03,279
Yes.

322
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,799
I never loved you.

323
00:19:12,359 --> 00:19:13,359
Bastard.

324
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:20,160
Then why did you lie to me?

325
00:19:24,880 --> 00:19:26,039
Why did I lie to you?

326
00:19:26,559 --> 00:19:28,119
Ask your wonderful big brother.

327
00:19:28,839 --> 00:19:30,920
If he hadn't threatened and bribed me
and used every trick in the book,

328
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:32,399
how could I have been with you?

329
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:34,000
How could I have left Shen Mo?

330
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:37,680
Big Brother Shen.

331
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:38,680
You...

332
00:19:40,039 --> 00:19:41,479
So you and my brother were fake too...

333
00:19:49,400 --> 00:19:50,599
You two are the real couple.

334
00:19:50,813 --> 00:19:51,613
Right?

335
00:19:51,720 --> 00:19:52,279
An'an.

336
00:19:52,279 --> 00:19:53,279
No.

337
00:19:55,680 --> 00:19:56,680
I understand now.

338
00:19:58,279 --> 00:19:59,279
Liars.

339
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,240
You're all liars.

340
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:02,960
It's not like that.

341
00:20:03,759 --> 00:20:05,038
An'an, let me explain.

342
00:20:05,039 --> 00:20:06,039
An'an.

343
00:20:06,759 --> 00:20:07,880
Don't follow me.

344
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:10,000
Please.

345
00:20:21,559 --> 00:20:23,240
Why did you say those things to An'an?

346
00:20:25,880 --> 00:20:26,880
What else could I do?

347
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,920
Lie to her for the rest of her life/?

348
00:20:35,759 --> 00:20:36,759
Mr. Ji.

349
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:40,078
An'an knows.

350
00:20:40,079 --> 00:20:41,079
Knows what?

351
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:45,839
About Zhou Yang and me.

352
00:20:46,799 --> 00:20:47,799
Where's An'an?

353
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:48,960
She ran out.

354
00:20:50,079 --> 00:20:51,079
She left.

355
00:21:07,799 --> 00:21:08,799
An'an.

356
00:21:13,039 --> 00:21:14,039
An'an.

357
00:21:14,119 --> 00:21:15,119
An'an.

358
00:21:15,519 --> 00:21:16,519
An'an.

359
00:21:30,400 --> 00:21:31,519
Please let her be okay.

360
00:21:32,559 --> 00:21:33,639
Please let her be okay.

361
00:21:33,640 --> 00:21:34,920
Please let her be okay.

362
00:21:36,200 --> 00:21:37,200
Shen Mo.

363
00:21:37,799 --> 00:21:38,799
Shen Mo.

364
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:40,240
Where's An'an?

365
00:21:40,279 --> 00:21:40,880
Where did she go?

366
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:41,880
Where are they?

367
00:21:43,039 --> 00:21:44,039
Shen Mo.

368
00:21:46,839 --> 00:21:48,358
Where did the girl who fainted go?

369
00:21:48,359 --> 00:21:49,359
Did you see her?

370
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:50,680
I didn't see her.

371
00:21:51,119 --> 00:21:52,119
Zhou Yang.

372
00:21:53,160 --> 00:21:54,160
Come here.

373
00:21:56,359 --> 00:21:57,000
Mom.

374
00:21:57,023 --> 00:21:58,023
An'an...

375
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:03,680
You good-for-nothing disgrace.

376
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:34,880
You're here.

377
00:22:35,400 --> 00:22:36,640
How is Miss Ji?

378
00:22:39,359 --> 00:22:40,359
She's still in surgery.

379
00:22:40,559 --> 00:22:41,680
What's her condition?

380
00:22:45,599 --> 00:22:46,599
Have a seat.

381
00:22:55,759 --> 00:22:57,239
An'an is eight years younger than me.

382
00:22:59,559 --> 00:23:01,759
The year she was born,
it happened to be spring.

383
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:05,319
The breeze felt warm against my skin.

384
00:23:06,119 --> 00:23:07,679
And carried the faint scent of flowers.

385
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:11,640
An'an was always easygoing as a child.

386
00:23:12,440 --> 00:23:14,799
She never cried or threw tantrums.

387
00:23:16,519 --> 00:23:18,200
She'd smile brightly at everyone she met.

388
00:23:22,480 --> 00:23:24,559
She looked so much like my mother.

389
00:23:26,119 --> 00:23:28,680
Sadly, not long after giving birth to her,
my mother passed away.

390
00:23:30,119 --> 00:23:31,759
From congenital heart disease.

391
00:23:39,920 --> 00:23:41,640
An'an inherited it too.

392
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:46,440
Medicine is so advanced now.

393
00:23:46,960 --> 00:23:48,680
Heart disease isn't untreatable.

394
00:23:51,920 --> 00:23:52,920
That's true.

395
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:57,359
She had surgery when she was very young.

396
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:01,640
Sadly, it didn't work very well.

397
00:24:06,039 --> 00:24:08,799
No one knew when she might leave this world.

398
00:24:13,799 --> 00:24:18,640
So I swore as a child
that I'd give An'an anything she wanted.

399
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:21,302
I wanted her to stay alive
every minute of every day.

400
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,039
And to live happily.

401
00:24:30,880 --> 00:24:32,960
But the one thing she wanted was Zhou Yang.

402
00:24:34,960 --> 00:24:36,839
I've never liked Zhou Yang.

403
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:40,240
But it didn't matter.

404
00:24:43,440 --> 00:24:45,200
As long as An'an was happy.

405
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:51,079
Everyone welcomed the marriage
alliance between the Zhou and Ji families.

406
00:24:55,759 --> 00:24:57,200
They just never expected...

407
00:25:03,000 --> 00:25:04,559
...that I would become an obstacle.

408
00:25:07,480 --> 00:25:09,160
Fortunately, Zhou Yang was smart.

409
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:12,520
He knew when to make compromises.

410
00:25:13,559 --> 00:25:14,919
Since he was willing to cooperate,

411
00:25:15,559 --> 00:25:17,559
I didn't mind giving An'an an illusion.

412
00:25:18,680 --> 00:25:21,119
One that would make her happy.

413
00:25:30,079 --> 00:25:31,640
As long as she was happy.

414
00:25:33,000 --> 00:25:34,000
An'an.

415
00:25:36,279 --> 00:25:37,279
How is An'an?

416
00:25:38,839 --> 00:25:39,839
Get lost.

417
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,758
The patient is temporarily out of danger.

418
00:25:49,759 --> 00:25:51,376
But her condition is still very unstable.

419
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:53,160
She can't endure any
more emotional distress.

420
00:25:56,359 --> 00:25:57,719
Family members, please step aside.

421
00:25:57,799 --> 00:25:59,079
Excuse me, please step aside.

422
00:25:59,160 --> 00:26:00,160
An'an.

423
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:01,240
An'an.

424
00:26:23,640 --> 00:26:24,640
An'an.

425
00:26:24,839 --> 00:26:25,720
Are you okay?

426
00:26:25,720 --> 00:26:26,720
How do you feel?

427
00:26:50,519 --> 00:26:51,119
Big Brother.

428
00:26:51,119 --> 00:26:53,121
An'an said she doesn't
want to see you.

429
00:26:53,839 --> 00:26:55,118
Shen Mo, come here

430
00:26:55,119 --> 00:26:56,279
I need to talk to you.

431
00:27:04,359 --> 00:27:05,359
Shen Mo.

432
00:27:07,319 --> 00:27:08,319
Mr. Ji.

433
00:27:09,759 --> 00:27:11,160
Does Miss Ji also

434
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:13,039
not want to see me?

435
00:27:16,160 --> 00:27:17,160
Shen Mo.

436
00:27:18,440 --> 00:27:20,160
I should apologize to you.

437
00:27:22,599 --> 00:27:23,599
I'm sorry.

438
00:27:24,960 --> 00:27:25,960
Don't.

439
00:27:34,119 --> 00:27:37,079
I was the one who told the Zhou family
about your relationship with Zhou Yang.

440
00:27:40,200 --> 00:27:41,200
I'm sorry.

441
00:27:41,980 --> 00:27:43,759
I'm the one who did this to you.

442
00:28:11,640 --> 00:28:13,040
I figured that out a long time ago.

443
00:28:14,200 --> 00:28:16,680
But hearing all this from Mr. Ji himself...

444
00:28:42,279 --> 00:28:43,359
This is for An'an.

445
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:45,240
To help her recover.

446
00:28:48,079 --> 00:28:49,079
Yeah.

447
00:28:51,160 --> 00:28:52,160
Mr. Ji.

448
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:54,680
Could you...

449
00:28:54,680 --> 00:28:55,680
Shen Mo.

450
00:28:57,160 --> 00:28:58,199
I did this to you.

451
00:28:58,200 --> 00:28:59,480
And you still came.

452
00:29:04,279 --> 00:29:08,960
You can't take all the blame
for what happened to me.

453
00:29:14,319 --> 00:29:15,759
Our contract is over.

454
00:29:17,880 --> 00:29:18,880
Go.

455
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:47,400
It's over.

456
00:29:49,400 --> 00:29:50,400
Shen Mo.

457
00:29:58,640 --> 00:30:01,839
Are you satisfied with
how things turned out?

458
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:03,679
I never thought things
would turn out this way

459
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:05,160
I don't want to lie to An'an anymore.

460
00:30:05,279 --> 00:30:06,479
My heart still belongs to you.

461
00:30:06,480 --> 00:30:07,960
You still have the nerve to say that.

462
00:30:08,512 --> 00:30:10,233
You're completely beyond saving.

463
00:30:10,376 --> 00:30:11,335
I've figured it out.

464
00:30:11,359 --> 00:30:12,359
I can have nothing.

465
00:30:12,360 --> 00:30:13,759
And I won't be tied down anymore.

466
00:30:13,783 --> 00:30:15,103
Wasn't I helping you too?

467
00:30:15,160 --> 00:30:17,320
You won't have to suffer at
Ji Mingxuan's side anymore.

468
00:30:19,839 --> 00:30:20,839
Shen Mo.

469
00:30:23,400 --> 00:30:24,839
To you, it was a shackle.

470
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:28,440
But to me, it never was.

471
00:30:57,359 --> 00:30:58,999
Wait until I draw a Ferris wheel for you.

472
00:31:01,559 --> 00:31:04,920
From when is this memory from?

473
00:31:06,599 --> 00:31:07,880
Is this my memory?
